# If you still want to combine with Solution 1

You can use both tools:

```java
searchTransfers(...)
analyzePersonTransfers(...)
```

Use:

- `analyzePersonTransfers(...)` for statistics and markdown.
- `searchTransfers(...)` only when the user asks to see actual individual transfer records.

For your current requirement, I would implement **`analyzePersonTransfers`** first.
